  dialogueLines:
  - '*I''ve been making pretty good time with these past few trips...*'
  - '*At this rate, I''m bound to reach Astoria soon-*'
  - '*Woah... this storm is getting pretty bad.*'
  - '*It would be too risky to keep driving in this weather. I should find somewhere
    to take shelter before it gets worse*'
  - '*Even if it means fighting through some more plants.*'
